# This file exists so the store reaches the repository.
#
# Git does not track an empty directory. Without this, a clone of this project would
# have no docs/fragments/, and a session opening here would walk up and file its units
# in the environment's store instead of this one.
#
# It is not a fragment and nothing reads it: the store is globbed for *.md.
# Delete it once this store holds a record of its own, or leave it - it costs nothing.
